if {hedgehogOpen} == false:
	Hedgehog: Oh… hello. I wasn’t expecting anyone.
	Hedgehog: I’ve been trying to keep everything alive by myself, and it’s… a lot.
	- Your plants look amazing!
		Hedgehog: Thanks… but even if they look good, I worry about all the little things.
	- Do you want help?
		Hedgehog: You’d… help me?
		Hedgehog: I suppose… maybe I could open for a little while.
		set {hedgehogOpen} = true
	- I just wanted to say hi.
		Hedgehog: Hi… it’s nice to meet someone… but I can’t step away right now.
elif {hedgehogOpen} and not {bunnyOpen}:
	Hedgehog: I’m glad someone’s helping me out… it makes a difference.
	Hedgehog: Hey, by the way, I stepped outside to care for the plants…
	Hedgehog: and I saw Bunny fussing with organizing her shelves. She looks like she could use a kind word.
	set {bunnyKey} = true
elif {gameEnd} == false:
	Hedgehog: These leaves aren’t going to water themselves.
else:
	Hedgehog: Ah… the town feels lively now. Nice work today!
if {squirrelKey} == true and {squirrelKey5}  ==  false:
	- Squirrel was wondering what time would be best for opening his library.
		Hedgehog: Hmm, I usually just open when it feels right.
		Hedgehog: I think it’s okay to take your time.
		set {squirrelKey5} = true
	- Later!
if {skunkKey} == true and {skunkKey2} == false:
	- What do you think of Skunk's coffee?
		Hedgehog: Ah… it’s calming. I like sitting there for a bit. Makes the morning feel easier.
		set {skunkKey2} = true
	- Later!
if {bearOpen} == true and {bearHedgehog} == false:
	- Hedgehog, a little sweet boost for your morning.
		Hedgehog: Delicious… I feel ready to tackle the day.
		set {bearHedgehog} = true
	- Later!
[signal arg="dialogue_end"]